# Comp3111LEx — .gitignore
# NOTE (Lab1 Step 2.2): IntelliJ's default .gitignore normally starts with "target/".
# The lab asks you to DELETE that line so the built .class files get committed.
# This file therefore intentionally does NOT ignore target/ or .idea —
# Lab1 Step 2.1.5 asks you to share project settings via VCS ("Always Add").

.DS_Store
*.log
